:"She is intelligent and is fluent in Japanese. She has no interest in Takurou because she is a lesbian. She is secretly in love with Testarossa but doesn't dare to reveal her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c106978"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68e58928350d7a8dae1f46e3ae171d05081cc3016ba8a19b8401ed30b7f922ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/064bdd6de8225519f3dd14e1f2ca299dda431ca5d2e19de9eed96e15d4e04b08.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中家 志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:55652","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c106980","characterName":"三日月 結華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c106980"},"originalCharacterName":"三日月 結華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The female president of the company Takurou works at. She is a brilliant and intelligent older woman who has all qualities required of being president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is strict with herself and kind to others. She can be quite harsh on Takurou when his work is not going well, unbeknownst to her, this has the opposite effect on him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c106980"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3c7c03711102b448f07fa1818dd885761c9279deb235c829a3609afdafdc558.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf2b6f702589654065787f05cb065bf13b1bd889dd34b83ea4235235233dc39a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"緒田 マリ","creatorId":"vndb:s574","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s574","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s574","name":"緒田 マリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:55651","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c106981","characterName":"長澤 亜美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c106981"},"originalCharacterName":"長澤 亜美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an office worker and management at a company. She is also Takurou's best friend. She is athletic and quite mannish. She tries to solve everything with her fighting spirit. After work, she goes to the gym to work out."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the project leader and Takurou works under her. She doesn't like the fact that Fukurou can't keep pace with other employees."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hates that Takurou always stays home, and treats him like he's a weak bean sprout."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c106981"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14757f9e6bd7a244ad0de5fd68cd8a9c7329fae91948e01a330b01db4f7c488e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac1df35904b97ac744af9242c00b0b6c4bbed42ad09f9a8f803bd36356cf1ad3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"東 かりん","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285"